---
import { processSteps } from '../../lib/catalogue';
---

<section id="process-confection" class="bg-[#00004B] px-6 py-16 text-white md:py-24" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
		<div class="grid gap-6 border-b border-white/15 pb-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-12 lg:pb-10">
			<div>
				<div class="mb-10">
					<div class="nx-head mb-5 text-[#F5B544]">
						<span class="nx-num">{ 02 }</span>
						<span class="nx-tag">Notre méthode</span>
					</div>
					<h2 id="process-heading" class="nx-display nx-display--lg nx-mask text-white">
						<span>Votre besoin, notre confection.</span>
					</h2>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-[1.85] text-white/60 md:text-base">
				Un parcours de travail lisible, du premier échange à la livraison. Les étapes et validations sont ajustées au vêtement, aux quantités et au cahier des charges.
			</p>
		</div>

		<ol class="catalogue-process-list mt-8 grid gap-x-6 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:mt-12 xl:grid-cols-4">
			{processSteps.map((step, index) => (
				<li data-process-step class="catalogue-process-step relative border-t border-white/20 py-5 pr-7 xl:py-6">
					<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
						<span class="font-display text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#F5B544]">{step.number}</span>
						{index < processSteps.length - 1 && (
							<span class="catalogue-process-arrow text-sm text-[#F5B544]/70" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
						)}
					</div>
					<h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-xl">{step.title}</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/55 md:text-sm">{step.text}</p>
				</li>
			))}
		</ol>
		<p class="mt-5 border-l border-[#F5B544]/70 pl-4 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-white/45">
			Les indications de quantité, de délai et de finition sont confirmées après étude de votre demande.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<script>
	const processStepsElements = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-process-step]'));
	const reduceProcessMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

	if (!reduceProcessMotion && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
		processStepsElements.forEach((element) => element.classList.add('catalogue-process-pending'));
		const processObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
			entries.forEach((entry) => {
				if (entry.isIntersecting) {
					entry.target.classList.add('catalogue-process-visible');
					processObserver.unobserve(entry.target);
				}
			});
		}, { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -30px 0px' });
		processStepsElements.forEach((element) => processObserver.observe(element));
	}
</script>

<style>
	.catalogue-process-step {
		transition: opacity 500ms ease, transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), border-color 180ms ease;
	}

	.catalogue-process-pending { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); }
	.catalogue-process-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
	.catalogue-process-step:hover { border-color: rgba(245, 181, 68, 0.7); }

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.catalogue-process-step { transition: none; }
	}
</style>
